==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₂eḱ-}}
{{bor+|ru|cu|поощрꙗти}}, featuring regressive palatalization across "р" (''стр'' > ''щр''). Another example of palatalization across a liquid is found in the conjugation of {{m|ru|слать}}. Compare native {{cog|ru|заостря́ть||to [[sharpen]], to [[emphasize]]}}, which does not feature such palatalization. {{surf|ru|по-|о́стрый|-ять}}. Ultimately from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*h₂eḱ-}}.

Compare typologically {{m|ru|подстрека́ть}}.

Also compare typologically:
* cognate: {{cog|en|egg on}} (ultimately from the same PIE root);
* noncognate: {{m+|cs|nabádat||[[urge]], [[exhort]]}}, akin to {{m+|ru|бода́ть}}, {{m+|bg|подтиквам}}, akin to {{m+|ru|ты́кать}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|поощря́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-поощрять.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|поощря́ть|impf|pf=поощри́ть}}

# to [[encourage]], to [[incentivise]], to [[abet]] {{gloss|to support, uphold, or aid}}

